{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121892","id":4161443503,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74Cpav","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121892","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121892.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121892.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121892","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121892/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121892/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121892/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/5f2eb26d917e12cbefda46bd13faca9853db163e","number":121892,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Android Editor: Expand Portrait Mode support and fix related issues","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121387\r\n\r\n- This PR expands portrait mode support to small devices (smart phones), when `distraction free mode` is enabled.\r\n- TouchActionsPanel caches different position in portrait and landscape, so when you switch from landscape to portrait it stays in the oplace where you last kept it in portrait.\r\n- Fixes Android Game window orientation handling.\r\n- Increases default scale by 5% on Android.\r\n- Improves 3D and 2D workspace toolbar to better resize to small window width.\r\n- Enables EditorTitleBar in portrait, and now only EditorRunBar is hidden.\r\n- Fixed the Project Manager resize issue and the compact threshold is now refreshed when the ProjectList size changes.\r\n- On Android, Project Manager and Editor Settings now always calculate their popup window size instead of caching it, ensuring they open at the maximum size when switching between portrait and landscape.\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121485\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122083\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15208","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"t